  "frameKeywordRules": {
    "_parent": "Resolves from the current frame's parent element to the nearest ancestor turbo-frame, never by document id. A literal frame id _parent does not take precedence. With no ancestor frame, navigation is not intercepted by the current frame; no missing-frame diagnostic or authored frame-id rename relation. With an ancestor, retain the ancestor relation and its disabled-state condition. Partial ancestry remains unknown."
